  "contentHtml": "<p>저희 &#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39;가</p><p>꿈꾸는 것을 소개합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수업에는 왕도가 없지만, 작은 수업아이디어를 함께 나누고,<br>그렇게 아이디어를 나누다보면 &#39;좋은 수업&#39;이라는 길(道)이 만들어질거라고 기대합니다. <br><br><b>길이란 원래는 없었지만 </b></p><p><b> 수많은 사람들의 발걸음에 의해 만들어진 것처럼...</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p>(아래는 저희 카페 대문글 모음입니다~)</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a4084e83c664e0440d97d69b0459513810ce5bb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a4084e83c664e0440d97d69b0459513810ce5bb\" data-origin-width=\"1309\" data-origin-height=\"667\"></div><p>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc15e7822e2cd99235c74000275c1822d625b187\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc15e7822e2cd99235c74000275c1822d625b187\" data-origin-width=\"681\" data-origin-height=\"291\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9d5e82c86c16a78047fb92375da722b79660b68\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9d5e82c86c16a78047fb92375da722b79660b68\" data-origin-width=\"1073\" data-origin-height=\"559\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93c758819ebb041a6c7b21918e0d6ab9b6ae38bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeatta